comments.message:
Check for error code here and log the message here.
Something like:

deleteDirectory(l_entry.path(), o_directoryRemoved, o_errCode);
if (o_errCode)
{
    Logger::getLoggerInstance()->logMessage(std::format(
            "Error while processing directory: {}",
             l_entry.path().string()));
             o_errCode = 0;

}

resetting the error code is important as we don't want it to propagate to parent call.
